      en: ["The site consists of 30 rock-cut Buddhist cave monuments.", "Construction occurred in two phases between 200 BCE and 650 CE.", "The caves were rediscovered by British officer John Smith in 1819.", "They are world-famous for their murals depicting Jataka stories.", "Ajanta is an exclusively Buddhist site, unlike the nearby Ellora Caves.", "It was designated as a UNESCO World Heritage site in 1983."],
